<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>古代美术文物展</title>
    <style>
        body {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            background-color: #222;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 40px;
            min-height: 100vh;
        }

        .poster {
            width: 800px;
            height: 1130px;
            background-color: #e6e3db;
            position: relative;
            box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5);
            font-family: "Noto Serif SC", "STSong", "SimSun", serif;
            color: #2c2c2c;
            overflow: hidden;
        }

        /* Top Left Section */
        .top-left-group {
            position: absolute;
            top: 80px;
            left: 60px;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: row;
            gap: 25px;
            align-items: flex-start;
            height: 250px;
        }

        .vertical-text {
            writing-mode: vertical-rl;
            text-orientation: mixed;
        }

        .title {
            font-size: 32px;
            font-weight: bold;
            letter-spacing: 6px;
            color: #222;
        }

        .separator {
            width: 1px;
            height: 200px;
            background-color: #888;
            margin-top: 5px;
        }

        .museum {
            font-size: 24px;
            letter-spacing: 8px;
            color: #222;
            font-weight: bold;
        }

        .address {
            font-size: 15px;
            line-height: 1.8;
            letter-spacing: 2px;
            color: #333;
        }

        .english-title {
            display: flex;
            gap: 8px;
            color: #a84545;
            font-family: "Times New Roman", serif;
            font-size: 16px;
            letter-spacing: 3px;
            margin-left: 10px;
        }

        /* Large Right Text */
        .large-text {
            position: absolute;
            right: 40px;
            font-size: 220px;
            line-height: 1.05;
            color: #2c2c2c;
            font-family: "STKaiti", "Kaiti", serif;
            text-align: center;
        }

        .large-text-top {
            top: 20px;
        }

        .large-text-bottom {
            top: 680px;
        }

        /* Middle Image Section */
        .image-placeholder {
            position: absolute;
            top: 360px;
            left: 0;
            width: 100%;
            height: 300px;
            background-color: #d4cebe;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            border-top: 1px solid #b5af9f;
            border-bottom: 1px solid #b5af9f;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        .image-placeholder::before {
            content: '[Landscape Painting Placeholder]';
            color: #777;
            font-size: 20px;
            font-family: sans-serif;
            letter-spacing: 1px;
        }

        .seal {
            position: absolute;
            top: 20px;
            right: 240px;
            width: 40px;
            height: 40px;
            border: 2px solid #a84545;
            color: #a84545;
            font-size: 16px;
            writing-mode: vertical-rl;
            text-align: center;
            padding: 2px;
            box-sizing: border-box;
            font-family: "STKaiti", "Kaiti", serif;
            background-color: rgba(230, 227, 219, 0.8);
            line-height: 1.1;
        }

        /* Bottom Left Section */
        .bottom-left-group {
            position: absolute;
            top: 740px;
            left: 60px;
            width: 550px;
        }

        .time-label {
            font-size: 16px;
            color: #555;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
            letter-spacing: 1px;
        }

        .date-row {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            font-family: "Times New Roman", serif;
            margin-bottom: 35px;
        }

        .date-num {
            font-size: 85px;
            line-height: 0.8;
            color: #222;
            letter-spacing: -2px;
        }

        .date-day {
            font-size: 18px;
            writing-mode: vertical-rl;
            text-orientation: upright;
            margin: 0 12px;
            color: #222;
            font-weight: bold;
            letter-spacing: 2px;
        }

        .date-arrow-group {
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            align-items: center;
            margin: 0 15px;
            transform: translateY(-5px);
        }

        .date-year {
            font-size: 16px;
            letter-spacing: 2px;
            margin-bottom: 5px;
            color: #222;
        }

        .date-arrow {
            width: 50px;
            height: 1px;
            background-color: #222;
            position: relative;
        }

        .date-arrow::after {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            right: -2px;
            top: -3px;
            border-top: 3px solid transparent;
            border-bottom: 3px solid transparent;
            border-left: 5px solid #222;
        }

        .desc-cn {
            font-size: 18px;
            line-height: 1.7;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
            font-weight: bold;
            color: #222;
            letter-spacing: 1px;
        }

        .desc-en {
            font-size: 11px;
            line-height: 1.6;
            color: #666;
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            letter-spacing: 0.5px;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <div class="poster">

        <!-- Top Left Info -->
        <div class="top-left-group">
            <div class="title vertical-text">古代美术文物展</div>
            <div class="separator"></div>
            <div class="museum vertical-text">琪琪艺术博物馆</div>
            <div class="address vertical-text">
                深圳市南山区金色<br>商业街001号
            </div>
            <div class="english-title">
                <div class="vertical-text">ART EXHIBITION</div>
                <div class="vertical-text">ANCIENT</div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Large Text Top -->
        <div class="large-text large-text-top">
            古<br>代
        </div>

        <!-- Middle Image Placeholder -->
        <div class="image-placeholder placeholder">
            <div class="seal">古代<br>艺术</div>
        </div>

        <!-- Large Text Bottom -->
        <div class="large-text large-text-bottom">
            美<br>术
        </div>

        <!-- Bottom Left Info -->
        <div class="bottom-left-group">
            <div class="time-label">展览时间 | Time</div>

            <div class="date-row">
                <div class="date-num">12.11</div>
                <div class="date-day">MON</div>
                <div class="date-arrow-group">
                    <div class="date-year">2023</div>
                    <div class="date-arrow"></div>
                </div>
                <div class="date-num">12.19</div>
                <div class="date-day">TUE</div>
            </div>

            <div class="desc-cn">
                史上首个以传世精品展示“唐宋八大家”家国情怀<br>
                和时代风华的主题文物展
            </div>

            <div class="desc-en">
                The first themed cultural relic exhibition in history<br>
                to showcase the "eight masters of the Tang and Song Dynasties"<br>
                family and country feelings and the elegance of the times with handed down masterpieces
            </div>
        </div>

    </div>

</body>
</html>
```
